<title>USA: Midwest Express Holdings Inc Q3 net up.</title>
<headline>Midwest Express Holdings Inc Q3 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.31		    $0.93</p>
<p> Net			  8,357		    6,305</p>
<p> Revs			83,123		   67,846</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,367		    6,429</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago Q3 results pro forma, and include $0.13 a share in non-recurring costs for employee stock grant and initial public offering.  </p>
<p>Q3 1996 operating income $13,331,000 vs $11,097,000.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 operating income reduced by $2.3 million due to higher fuel prices.</p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.78		    $2.31</p>
<p> Net			 17,783		   16,209</p>
<p> Revs		     226,576		  195,780</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,408		    6,429</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1996 operating income $28,342,000 vs $26,571,000.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 operating income cut by $6.0 million by higher fuel prices.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
